-desk/services/computerlabs","source_title":"Computer Labs and Classrooms | Luther College","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Use during posted library hours; library schedules vary by term and break period.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"hanson-vesterheim-commons","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Hanson Vesterheim Commons","title":"Visit Hanson Vesterheim Commons","subtitle":"Vesterheim campus, Decorah","notes":"Meet under the timber canopy, look through the welcome center and gallery if open, then continue into the adjacent outdoor heritage grounds.","short_summary":"A daily-open community space connected to Vesterheim Heritage Park.","evidence_claim":"Vesterheim states that Hanson Vesterheim Commons is open daily from 9 a.m. to 5 p.m. with no admission charge.","source_url":"https://vesterheim.org/vesterheim-commons-is-open/","source_title":"Vesterheim Commons Is Open | Vesterheim Norwegian-American Museum","source_kind":"cultural_institution","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Open daily 9 a.m.–5 p.m. according to Vesterheim; special-gallery availability can vary.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"decorah-ice-cave","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Decorah Ice Cave State Preserve","title":"See Decorah Ice Cave","subtitle":"Van Peenen Memorial Park, Decorah","notes":"Take the stairs to the cave entrance with a friend, use careful footing, and leave time to observe seasonal ice from a safe distance.","short_summary":"A named geological preserve with a narrow limestone cave passage.","evidence_claim":"Iowa DNR states that Decorah Ice Cave is open to the public free of charge.","source_url":"https://www.iowadnr.gov/places-go/state-preserves/decorah-ice-cave-state-preserve","source_title":"Decorah Ice Cave State Preserve | Iowa Department of Natural Resources","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Footing can be hazardous and rocks may be loose; follow DNR cautions and do not disturb ice or rock.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"chuck-gipp-decorah-fish-hatchery","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Chuck Gipp Decorah Fish Hatchery","title":"Watch Trout at the Hatchery","subtitle":"Decorah, Iowa","notes":"Walk the raceways, read the interpretive plaques, and use the picnic shelter for a conversation break without buying fish feed.","short_summary":"A public hatchery with raceways, interpretation, and a year-round shelter.","evidence_claim":"Iowa DNR states that the Chuck Gipp Decorah Fish Hatchery is open to the public 365 days a year from sunrise to sunset.","source_url":"https://www.iowadnr.gov/news-release/2024-07-09/new-watershed-plan-improves-water-quality-chuck-gipp-decorah-fishery-hatchery","source_title":"New watershed plan improves water quality at the Chuck Gipp Decorah Fishery Hatchery | Iowa DNR","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":"2024-07-09","source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Public access is sunrise to sunset; fish feed is optional and is not needed for a visit.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"trout-run-trail","subject_type":"activity","entity_name":"Trout Run Trail","title":"Walk a Section of Trout Run Trail","subtitle":"Starting near the Decorah Fish Hatchery","notes":"Choose a daylight out-and-back segment, walk at a conversational pace, and use the hatchery area as a simple start and finish point.","short_summary":"An 11-mile Decorah-area trail for a flexible walk or roll.","evidence_claim":"Iowa DNR identifies Trout Run Trail as an 11-mile route through Decorah and says the hatchery is a starting point for it.","source_url":"https://www.iowadnr.gov/news-release/2024-07-09/new-watershed-plan-improves-water-quality-chuck-gipp-decorah-fishery-hatchery","source_title":"New watershed plan improves water quality at the Chuck Gipp Decorah Fishery Hatchery | Iowa DNR","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":"2024-07-09","source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Use daylight, account for weather, and share the multiuse trail courteously.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"decorah-community-prairie","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Decorah Community Prairie","title":"Walk the Community Prairie","subtitle":"Decorah, Iowa","notes":"Follow the mowed walking paths, pause at the butterfly garden, and pick a short loop that fits the season and your group’s pace.","short_summary":"A city prairie with walking paths and a seasonal butterfly garden.","evidence_claim":"Decorah Parks and Recreation describes the Decorah Community Prairie as having mowed walking paths, a butterfly garden, and a community garden.","source_url":"https://parks.decorahia.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/Parks-Trail-Guide.pdf","source_title":"Park Amenities & Descriptions | Decorah Parks and Recreation","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Use the paths and respect seasonal planting areas and any posted site rules.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"phelps-park","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Phelps Park","title":"Hang Out at Phelps Park","subtitle":"Park Street, Decorah","notes":"Bring a conversation, a book, or a game you already own, then use the overlooks, picnic area, playground, and hiking trail at your own pace.","short_summary":"Decorah’s first park, with a playground, shelters, lookouts, and trail.","evidence_claim":"Decorah Parks and Recreation identifies Phelps 