le by following the shared-rink rules.","short_summary":"A seasonal public ice-rink and warming-house activity.","evidence_claim":"Decorah Parks and Recreation states that use of the Carl Selland Wayside Park rink and warming house is free and open to the public.","source_url":"https://parks.decorahia.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Decorah-Parks-and-Recreation-Rules-and-Regulations-Doc-As-of-2.19.24.pdf","source_title":"Decorah Parks and Recreation Rules and Regulations","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Seasonal only; check the entrance sign or Parks and Recreation for ice-open status and warming-house hours.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":[]}],"warnings":[]}
